Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.27,1:42:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.64,1:42:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想 我才19岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking, and, you know, I'm 19 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.94,1:42:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能为了一棵树 放弃一片森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a whole world out there. I can't be obsessed with one woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.18,1:42:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 我很高兴你想通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just can't be. - I'm glad you're learning, Finchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.45,1:42:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.42,1:42:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要上车吗？- 你最好把事情排开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to get it on? - You better clear your schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.80,1:42:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you guys later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.90,1:42:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪？说好了要一起去吃饭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you goin', man? What about Dog Years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.03,1:42:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我…三天的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me, like, three days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.74,1:42:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 那该不会是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, was that… Was that who I think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.18,1:42:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 一定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.58,1:42:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得是 - 我也觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think it was. - I think so too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.21,1:42:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.15,1:42:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.19,1:43:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.75,1:43:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was… Someone was lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.52,1:43:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想去湖边 - 开错路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lookin' for the lake. - Yeah, all turned around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.73,1:43:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪来的白痴啊 湖就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a dumb ass. The lake's right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.54,1:43:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇怎么这么好狗运？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredible. How does Finch get so lucky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.37,1:43:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,羡慕什么？你有女朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you worried about? You got a girlfriend now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.68,1:43:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西都拿了 出发去吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in. Let's go. Pony up. Dog Years awaits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.71,1:43:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do. Yeah, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.85,1:43:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有女朋友了 - 对 你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a girlfriend now. - Yeah, you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.02,1:43:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是我女朋友 - 别兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's my girlfriend. - All right, Jimbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.55,1:43:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.55,1:43:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 变态呢？- 去看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Shitbreak? - The movies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.99,1:43:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去搭公车 - 去喝咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Took the bus. - Coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.82,1:43:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.03,1:43:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆车里到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck was in that car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.27,1:43:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇 我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Finchy, I missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.94,1:43:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Oh, Jeanine.Jeanine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.21,1:43:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我史勒的妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me Stifler's mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.21,1:44:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 史勒的妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Stifler's mom!{\r}
